  "_note": "Mechanics only — every name lives in theme.json. Twenty tiles: ten indoor (the village and the 義莊 at the end of it) and ten outdoor (the hillside). `exits` are the tile's own doors before rotation; the game turns tiles as it places them. `search` names the one category this room can be rummaged for, and is data only — the pool itself is not designed yet. `exteriorDoor` names which base edge is the way between worlds, and must be one of `exits`: it costs the room a door rather than adding a fifth. `pray` names a tile this room can summon to the top of its stack, once per night.",
